cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use DocGen, please cite the paper below."
title: "DocGen"
type: software
abstract: >-
  DocGen is a template any GitHub organization or user can use to turn the
  READMEs of their public repositories into a structured, searchable
  Docusaurus documentation catalog that links back to each source repo, driven by agent skills from an AI-powered IDE
  and deployed on push with GitHub Actions.
authors:
